Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙为何救他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,狩猎开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,关于昨夜凌晨发生的爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,已查明是由老式发电机流出的液体燃料…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,勇猛的猎鹰们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,父巢出现了叛逃的黑鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,黑鸦欺骗巢穴 庇护大敌之虎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们无法逃出这片土地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要找出他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,挖出他们的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好别动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是这最先进的纳米治疗仪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让你痊愈也是要花时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你想问我为什么救你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 烤鸭先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思一直在骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的临时身份 这张脸也不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了接近我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,组织首领交给我的任务是摸清你的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾一度死去 又因奥义的力量而复活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不摸清你的奥义 不论杀你多少次 你都会复活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,奥义只在战斗的关键时刻才用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我受命接近监视你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,揭露你的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我以FBI的艾玛的身份接近你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克知道这事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.70,0:04:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,以上说的是身为组织忍者一员的我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有另一个身份
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,终于能跟你对话了 彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 协助你的就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为了能让你成功复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你一边受组织之命刺探我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一边不惜背叛组织协助我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我有我自己的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为此不能让你死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再与他们战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你必定难逃一死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那套装备就是有那么强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,即便你使出奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是怎样的招式 都不可能让你逃出那险境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还有胜算
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是能杀死他们的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.57,0:05:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,装备吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了做耐久测试
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,而被带到这里的开发中的装备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这边应该是她事先准备的 在叛变时抢夺装备用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有任何改变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}西D{\r}区 排查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}南C{\r}区 排查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一切照旧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,具足装备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是以忍术为核心的超高性能战斗装备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,融合了组织六百年的忍者历史
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}和{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的最新技术而诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是恶魔的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是研发团队的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是其中最先进的装备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦完成 会成为你新的助力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在此之前组织找到我们了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}北A{\r}区 排查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你说好会保护我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一醒来就这么烦心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你可整整睡了十天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,十天?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这段时间 我一个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.79,0:07:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你包的?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是我认识的一个医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他什么都别问
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,钱已经付给他了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用的是我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是 混账有钱人的别墅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这个时节不用 很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我聪明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可别跟我摆什么FBI架子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你也在被追捕 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,估计我进城之前就被尾随了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我已有所戒备
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但没想到他们那时来抓人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这点足以证明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接近了他们想要隐藏的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,输出功率还不够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,相当于装备心脏的动力炉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这个部件需要使用总部的设备
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻了 这不是自投罗网吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的办法…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冽如火?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,说反了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,人动怒时难以保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,相反 过于谨慎时会丧失激情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,人的心境总是不如所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你能同时保有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,火和冰这两种相反的意志的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就没有人能伤到你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我心中的忍者奥秘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冽如火 炽热如冰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如此磨炼心境
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩这一个区域了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个净水厂的用电量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从两周前起急剧上升
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,推测厂内在运行某种大型机器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的发型格外好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这样动力炉和装甲部分就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这件新型具足装备名为神威
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是以最高战力为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,采用全新设计思路制作的原型机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所以和其他装备不同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,光是穿上它并不会发挥其力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这件装备依靠连接使用者的脑波
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在大脑想象动作的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,装备会响应 并开始运转
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,其响应速度远超之前的机型
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的想象越强力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就越能快速地 强劲地驱动它
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,简而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这件装备会回应使用者的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然而要做到这些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,必须让装备和你的大脑完全同步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在这道工序期间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你会陷入完全睡眠状态
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不论发生什么 你都无法醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是心脏被刺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,记住我这句话就行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,下次丢了性命 等待你的将是真正的死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让你复活的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那时 我用了自己的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这招通过刺激特殊经络来停止身体细胞的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让你暂时陷入假死状态
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但用过一次之后 经络会关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没法再次复活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么让我复活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的妻儿 而是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能让他俩活下来 我的命根本不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有一手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们被诱饵骗到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.67,0:13:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 小鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大灰狼来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会真以为我在开幸运饼干抽奖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,舔遍整个城市都没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,想必你们不会这就下地狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩一种可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一直在移动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,从应召女郎的接送车到婴儿车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城里的所有车辆的行车记录
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都被记录在中央服务器里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在这之中 自从你们消失以来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.97,Top,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一辆车一直在行驶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这 一 辆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,想得真周到啊 这样一来的确
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,即便每天像条狗一样地奔波 也不会有人怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,同步率仍然只{\fsp8}有{\r}10%
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那个忍者男孩不是你的 是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这次一定要玩到最后 直至高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我做梦都在想这个 一次就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想试试和同样穿装备的人打一架
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看我干趴你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,首先来调查名单上的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么个调查法?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你 我没法回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就算要潜{\fsp8}入{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的数据库…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,缺台设备
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 这方面我是门外汉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事她更擅长…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那台
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她那台
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可别轻易就哀嚎了哦 让我再沸腾些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本算不上忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是个渴求刺激的可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 你才选择一人前来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,组织这玩意 我打心底就不关心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊 就是想战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,无论干掉多少杂鱼都不满足
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就要这种粉身碎骨的互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才当了忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你这种货色根本不及真正忍者的一根脚趾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,又短又小
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这是至今为止最让我心动的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是最棒的臭婆娘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,侵占我的视线是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你这点实力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还妄想和我一同起舞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还… 不够
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一点…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能听见我的声音吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这段录音被直接送到你的深层意识
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.35,0:19:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当你听到这些时 我或许已不在人世
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么救了你?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前曾被你的妻子 鞠 救过一命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,之后我一直与鞠保持秘密联系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.31,0:20:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在总部得知袭击的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救你们而前来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可我赶到时 他俩已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,当时只能来得及救你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 没能救下你的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没能救下你的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正因如此 我无论如何都想要完成她的遗愿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠那时想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「活下去」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做的只有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.59,0:21:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我心中的忍者奥秘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冽如火 炽热如冰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如此磨炼心境
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:45.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:50.50,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:55.75,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:38.63,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:43.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,5,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:45.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:50.50,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:55.75,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:38.63,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:43.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
